      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "garded as so well settled that it need be allowed to interfere",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "with or modify any conclusions arrived at by other lines of",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "reasoning. Nor should I be unprepared to abandon the opinion",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "about Kâlidâsa's priority over Bhartṛihari, if any arguments were",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "forthcoming which appeared to me to necessitate it, for, as I",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "have stated, that priority does not appear to myself to result in-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "controvertibly from the fact from which it is deduced. And last-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "ly, so long as Kâlidâsa is not shown to have flourished at any",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "particular period, I am not aware that there are any grounds for",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "supposing that he cannot have flourished even earlier than the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 11,
          "text": "first century of the Christian Era.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "Having thus fixed the date at which our author probably",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "flourished, we must now proceed to other inquiries concerning",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "him. It will have been marked that for fixing the date more",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "precisely than we should have been able to fix it uopn the evi-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "dence furnished by the Panchatantra alone, we have made use of",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "the tradition which connects Bhartṛihari and king Vikrama as",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "brothers. Now Dr. Bhâu Dâjî in his paper on Kâlidâsa has ques-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "tioned this tradition. But before proceeding to consider his objec-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "tion, it may be just as well to set out here the information on",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 11,
          "text": "this subject which is given by the several manuscripts that have",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 12,
          "text": "been consulted for this edition. In the MS. which we have de-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 13,
          "text": "nominated M. what may be called the title page has the follow-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 14,
          "text": "ing : ॥ अथ भर्तृहर (sic) भूपतिकृतवैराग्यशतकप्रारम्भः ॥ The last page of the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 15,
          "text": "same has this : इति श्रीभर्तृहर (sic again) भूपति &c., as before. In the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 16,
          "text": "MS. called R. we have the following Colophon ॥ इति श्रीमहामुनीन्द्र-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 17,
          "text": "भर्तृहरिकृतौ वैराग्यशतकस्य टीका समाप्ता ॥ In the MS. of the Sṛingâras'ataka",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 18,
          "text": "in the R. set, however, we have ॥ इति श्रीमहाकविचक्रचूडामणिना भर्तृहरिणा",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 19,
          "text": "विरचितं शृङ्गारशतं (sic) द्वितीयं संपूर्णम् ॥ The printed copy N. has इति श्रीभर्तृ-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 20,
          "text": "हरियोगीन्द्रेण विरचिते (sic) सुभाषितत्रिशत्यां वैराग्यशतकं संपूर्णमभूत्. The Colo-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 21,
          "text": "",
          "end": "hyphen"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
